@startuml M6-Component-Interactions

' Shows detailed interaction flow between all components in search pipeline
' Traces exact sequence of function calls: CLI to QueryParser to ProcessQuery to SearchService to TfIdf to MetadataBoost to final result
' Separate flows shown for indexing pipeline with DocumentProcessor, SeedLoader, GitHubAPI
' Each numbered arrow shows the execution order and data passing between classes

!define BGCOLOR #F5F5F5
!define ACCENTCOLOR #1F77B4
!define ACCENTCOLOR2 #FF7F0E

skinparam backgroundColor BGCOLOR
skinparam classBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
skinparam classBorderColor ACCENTCOLOR
skinparam arrowColor #333

title M6 Search Engine - Component Interaction Diagram

class CLI {
  - query: string
  - filters: object
  ---
  + search(query, options)
  + displayResults(results)
}

class QueryParser {
  ---
  + parse(rawQuery)
  + extractFilters(query)
  + parseLanguageFilter()
  + parseOwnerFilter()
}

class QueryProcessor {
  ---
  + process(parsedQuery)
  + normalizeTerms()
  + generateVariations()
  + prepareForSearch()
}

class DocumentProcessor {
  - text: string
  ---
  + process(document)
  + extractReadmeText()
  + normalizeText()
  + tokenize()
  + stem()
  + generateNgrams()
}

class SearchService {
  - index: Map
  ---
  + search(query, options)
  + scoreDocuments()
  + filterResults()
  + rankResults()
  + limitResults()
}

class TfIdf {
  ---
  + calculateTF(term, document)
  + calculateIDF(term, corpus)
  + calculateTfIdf(term, document, corpus)
}

class MetadataBoost {
  ---
  + boostByStars()
  + boostByLanguage()
  + boostByTopics()
  + combinedBoost()
}

class ScoreCalculator {
  ---
  + calculateScore(tfIdf, metadata)
  + combineScores(weights)
}

class IndexEntry {
  - term: string
  - postings: Array
  - documentFrequency: number
  ---
  + addPosting(docId, frequency)
  + getPostings()
}

class RepoDocument {
  - owner: string
  - repo: string
  - language: string
  - readmeText: string
  ---
  + validate()
  + getMetadata()
}

class SearchResult {
  - repoId: string
  - score: number
  - highlights: Array
  ---
  + filterByLanguage()
  + filterByOwner()
  + sortByScore()
}

class StorageKeys {
  {static} INVERTED_INDEX_PREFIX
  {static} TF_INDEX_PREFIX
  {static} DF_INDEX_PREFIX
  ---
  {static} + indexKey(term)
  {static} + tfKey(term)
  {static} + dfKey(term)
}

class SeedLoader {
  ---
  + loadSeeds(filepath)
  + parseRepository()
  + validateFormat()
  + expandRepoUrl()
}

class GitHubAPI {
  ---
  + getRepositoryMetadata(owner, repo)
  + getReadmeContent(owner, repo)
  + getRepositoryStars()
  + getTopics()
}

class ResultFormatter {
  - format: string
  ---
  + format(results)
  + formatAsCLI()
  + formatAsJSON()
  + formatAsCSV()
}

'' Interactions
CLI --> QueryParser: "1. Parse user query"
QueryParser --> QueryProcessor: "2. Send parsed query"
QueryProcessor --> SearchService: "3. Prepared search terms"
SearchService --> TfIdf: "4. Calculate TF-IDF scores"
TfIdf --> MetadataBoost: "5. Apply metadata weights"
MetadataBoost --> ScoreCalculator: "6. Combine scores"
ScoreCalculator --> SearchService: "7. Combined scores"
SearchService --> SearchResult: "8. Create result objects"
SearchResult --> ResultFormatter: "9. Format results"
ResultFormatter --> CLI: "10. Display formatted output"

DocumentProcessor --> RepoDocument: "Validate document shape"
DocumentProcessor --> IndexEntry: "Create index entries"
DocumentProcessor --> StorageKeys: "Get storage key names"

SeedLoader --> GitHubAPI: "Fetch repository metadata"
GitHubAPI --> RepoDocument: "Create document objects"
RepoDocument --> DocumentProcessor: "Process for indexing"

SearchService --> IndexEntry: "Lookup postings"
IndexEntry --> StorageKeys: "Use index keys"

note right of CLI
  Entry point for user
  interactions. Coordinates
  search workflow.
end note

note right of QueryParser
  Parses raw query strings
  and extracts filters like
  language and owner.
end note

note right of DocumentProcessor
  Pipeline for preparing
  documents for indexing.
  Applies full text
  processing chain.
end note

note right of SearchService
  Core search logic:
  matches queries against
  index and ranks results.
end note

note right of ScoreCalculator
  Combines TF-IDF (75%)
  with metadata factors
  (25%) for final ranking.
end note

@enduml
